---
description: Safe editing rules for wrapper shell scripts
globs: openclaw-secure/scripts/**/*.sh, openclaw-raw/scripts/**/*.sh
alwaysApply: false
---

# Shell scripts (`openclaw-secure/scripts/`, `openclaw-raw/scripts/`)

- Keep **bash** portable for **Linux and macOS** (POSIX-ish patterns; avoid GNU-only assumptions without guards).
- Add behavior in the matching tree’s **`_common.sh`** instead of copying logic across scripts.
- When changing paths, keep existing **`OPENCLAW_*`** validation and **refuse-unsafe-directory** checks.
